# `npm run dev` (Vite mode "development"): the app on :5173, the local Worker on :8787 behind the dev proxy.
# Public values only — every VITE_* value is compiled into the bundle. Defaults live in src/config.ts, every
# variable is listed in .env.example; `.env` / `.env.development.local` (git-ignored) override this file.
# Our own services first; where this machine hasn't built a dataset or started an engine, the public fallbacks
# answer (npm run seed:local, data:weather, engines:up fill the gaps).

# Our API on the page's own origin (the dev proxy forwards /api to the Worker).
VITE_API_ORIGIN=
